PUBLIC RESPONSE: {H}

The pattern of consistent, identical blanks across all surviving copies strongly implies the omissions were introduced at the point of the (now-lost) archetype or were deliberate redactions by copyists, not later physical degradation, invisible ink, or esoteric color-coding.  

H is the least plausible of the eight options because it fabricates an ahistorical syncretism of Kuji-in, Taoist “nine holes,” and erotic chakra rituals that has zero support in any extant ninjutsu manuscript, in the known biography of Fujibayashi, or in the editorial practices of the Iga/Kōka schools. All other choices, while varying in historical probability, at least remain within the documented bounds of 17th-century secrecy practices, moral censorship, or state control of intelligence material. H alone requires an entirely invented doctrinal framework for which no evidence exists.}

